plorpOS (plorpos-f1p.95.15): a set that fails to load in the resident Diatom
(too big for the Flip's memory) shows FBNeo's error screen and leaves the
emulator usable for the next game.
- neo_run.cpp: NeoInit cleared 'recursing' on success only. A failed ROM load
  left it set, NeoExit then freed nothing and the next Neo Geo game skipped its
  hardware init (uPD4990A clock never set -> divide by zero on frame 1).
- retro_input.cpp: with no driver loaded, set_controller_port_device used the
  previous game's input count against no driver (SIGSEGV).
- ugui_tools.c: the error screen's buffer was allocated on every failed load
  and never freed, and drawn into unchecked.

